# Advisory style for this repo (not CI-enforced: no mass reformat, so that
# diffs stay reviewable against the frozen golden contract in AGENTS.md).
# New/edited code should already look like this; run
#   clang-format --dry-run --Werror <files>
# locally if you have clang-format installed (any recent version).
BasedOnStyle: LLVM
IndentWidth: 4
ContinuationIndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 100
PointerAlignment: Right
ReferenceAlignment: Right
SortIncludes: Never
ReflowComments: Never
AllowShortFunctionsOnASingleLine: None
BreakBeforeBraces: Attach
SpaceBeforeParens: ControlStatements
